# Override .gitignore for gcloud source uploads. .gitignore excludes
# configs/ and .env (correct for git), but if we ever go back to needing
# them at build time we don't want to silently lose them like happened
# on 2026-05-12. Today the server doesn't strictly need .env (it logs +
# continues without one), but keeping configs/ in the upload remains
# correct for any local-dev parity.

*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
.idea/
.DS_Store
sbs-drafts-server
